+  "history": [
+    {
+      "zh": "2026-10-08：由β=0足够条件推进至0≤β≤5/12及其精确全初态边界，保留临界误差与超临界反例；旧证书和支持结果直接复用。",
+      "en": "2026-10-08: strengthened beta=0 sufficiency to 0<=beta<=5/12 and the exact universal-state boundary, retaining critical-error and supercritical counterexamples; original certificates and stock results are reused."
+    },
+    {
+      "zh": "2026-10-09：核读既有研究§§41–46的LibreOffice形成对应；原定理、条件和回执均保留，新历史评估另记formed-software-continuation，未作数值映射。",
+      "en": "2026-10-09: reconciled study sections 41–46 on LibreOffice formation; original theorem, hypotheses and receipt remain, with the new historical assessment in formed-software-continuation and no numerical mapping."
+    },
+    {
+      "zh": "2026-10-09：核读同一研究§§47–52的API接续与保留依存评估；先前正文原字节前缀保留。此对应未改变本条数学命题、前提或回执，也未提供数量化参数。",
+      "en": "2026-10-09: reconciles sections 47–52 on API continuation and retained dependence; original study/chapter byte prefixes remain. The assessment changes no mathematical claim, hypothesis or receipt and supplies no quantitative parameters."
+    },
+    {
+      "zh": "2026-10-14：按旧记录一般律审计，主张改为一般律先行。新核心模块 Becoming.Lasting：确定的律永不到达目标恰当某个避开目标的封闭集含起点，即目标补集的生存核；经外围 MarketInstances，5/12 边界读作固定质量处的余量非负，也读作没有避开着陆的封闭集含正状态，边界之上的不动点是 fixed_avoids 的实例。着陆一侧的增益估计仍是该市场律的。scratch_build 实编，核心公理报告为空，外围只用标准公理；回执由落地运行绑定。原定理、回执与反例不变。",
+      "en": "2026-10-14: under the general-law audit of older records, the claim now states the law first. New core module Becoming.Lasting: a determined law never reaches a target exactly when a closed set avoiding it contains the start, the viability kernel of the complement; through the periphery MarketInstances the 5/12 boundary reads as a nonnegative margin at the fixed quality and as no closed set avoiding landing containing a positive state, the fixed point above it being an instance of fixed_avoids. The gain estimate on the landing side remains the market law's. Built with scratch_build: core axiom reports empty, the periphery with standard axioms only; the landing run binds the receipts. The original theorems, receipts and counterexamples are unchanged."
+    },
+    {
+      "zh": "2026-10-16，P114 散立的模块在共同基底上陈述（研究 §138；Ren 2026-10-15：“so for our theories, they are proved in a dag order and can be all connected right?”）：主律在共同基底上陈述，不加前提：确定之律的过程所到达者就是其轨道（reach_iff_orbit）。所以其过程从 s 所到达的构型都不在目标中，恰当某个含 s、避开目标且在律下封闭的集合存在（avoids_iff_closed_reach）；某个种子永不到达，恰当一个避开目标的封闭集含有某个种子（some_avoids_iff_reach）；目标之外的不动构型不到达目标（fixed_avoids_reach）。漏斗或每个盆在第 n 级所含的起点，在受扰过程的每个运行上 n 步之内到达目标（Funnel.runs、basin_runs）；对确定之律，至多 n 步的历程到达目标恰当一个漏斗含起点，目标判定时恰当一个数值变式在起点至多为 n（course_reaches_iff_funnel、course_reaches_iff_variant）。Becoming.Courses 由核心运行编译与审计（回执 20261015T172257.067968Z），公理报告为空。论断、假设、Ren 的话、依赖与既有证明不变；只加引用、绑定、别名与本条。",
+      "en": "16 October 2026, P114, the apart modules read on the shared base (study section 138; Ren, 15 October: “so for our theories, they are proved in a dag order and can be all connected right?”): the main law stated on the shared base, no premise added: what a determined law's process reaches is its orbit (reach_iff_orbit). So no configuration its process reaches from s is in the target exactly when some set holding s, avoiding the target and closed under the law exists (avoids_iff_closed_reach); some seed never reaches it exactly when a closed set avoiding the target holds a seed (some_avoids_iff_reach); a fixed configuration outside the target never reaches it (fixed_avoids_reach). A start that a funnel, or every basin, holds at level n meets the target within n steps on every run of the disturbed process (Funnel.runs, basin_runs); for a determined law, a course of at most n moves reaches the target exactly when a funnel holds the start, and, with the target decided, exactly when a numeric variant is at most n there (course_reaches_iff_funnel, course_reaches_iff_variant). Becoming.Courses is compiled and audited by the core run (receipt 20261015T172257.067968Z), with empty axiom reports. Claims, hypotheses, Ren's words, dependencies and the earlier proofs are unchanged; only references, bindings, aliases and this entry are added."
