+  "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-10-28T05:53:06+00:00",
+  "statement": {
+    "en": "For a law driven by admissible disturbances, given one, no history from a start leaves the guard exactly when some set containing the start lies within the guard and is closed under every admissible disturbance; in the market the safe rectangle is such a set under a valid protection certificate.",
+    "zh": "对由可容许扰动驱动的律（给定一个可容许扰动），从某起点出发的历史都不离开守卫，恰当有包含该起点、在守卫之内、对每个可容许扰动封闭的集合；在市场模型中，有效保护证书之下的安全矩形就是这样的集合。"
+  },
+  "laws": [
+    {
+      "en": "For every process and guard, the viability kernel holds the configurations from which no course leaves the guard, and a certificate is a set within the guard that every step keeps. A configuration is in the kernel exactly when some certificate contains it; the kernel is itself a certificate and contains every other; and a configuration is in it exactly when it is within the guard and every successor is in it.",
+      "zh": "对每个过程与守卫：生存核含没有进程从其离开守卫的构型；证书是守卫之内、每一步都保持的集合。构型在核中，恰当某个证书含有它；核本身是证书，且包含其他每个证书；构型在核中，恰当它在守卫之内且每个后继都在核中。",
+      "declarations": [
+        "Becoming.Viability.Kernel",
+        "Becoming.Viability.Certificate",
+        "Becoming.Viability.kernel_iff_certificate",
+        "Becoming.Viability.kernel_largest",
+        "Becoming.Viability.kernel_step_iff"
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "en": "For a law of change driven by disturbances with an admissibility condition, given one admissible disturbance, no history driven by admissible disturbances ever leaves the guard exactly when some set containing the start lies within the guard and is closed under every admissible disturbance.",
+      "zh": "对带可容许条件的扰动所驱动的变化之律，给定一个可容许扰动：由可容许扰动驱动的历史永不离开守卫，恰当有某个含起点的集合在守卫之内，且对每个可容许扰动封闭。",
+      "declarations": [
+        "Becoming.Viability.never_leaves_iff_certificate"
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "en": "With the guard decided, the guarded history stops at the first step beginning or ending outside the guard; it agrees with the history at every time exactly when the history stays within the guard, so, given one admissible disturbance, no guarded history driven by admissible disturbances stops exactly when such a closed set contains the start.",
+      "zh": "守卫可判定时，受守卫的历史在第一个始于或终于守卫之外的步停止；它在每个时刻与历史一致，恰当历史留在守卫之内；所以给定一个可容许扰动，由可容许扰动驱动的受守卫历史都不停止，恰当这样的封闭集含起点。",
+      "declarations": [
+        "Becoming.Viability.guarded_iff",
+        "Becoming.Viability.guarded_never_fails_iff"
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "en": "Two witnesses: in a two-configuration process the guard holds at a configuration from which one step leaves it, so the guard alone need not be a certificate; and with no admissible disturbance every history condition holds vacuously while no set within an empty guard contains the start, so the given admissible disturbance is needed.",
+      "zh": "两个见证：在两个构型的过程中，守卫在某构型处成立，而一步就离开它，故守卫本身未必是证书；没有可容许扰动时，每个历史条件空真成立，而空守卫之内没有集合含起点，故所给的可容许扰动是需要的。",
+      "declarations": [
+        "Becoming.Viability.Leaves.within_not_kernel",
+        "Becoming.Viability.needs_admissible"
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "en": "In the market model, for every parameter set, bound set and start, the market's history and guarded history are the core's, with the essential floors as guard, and the worst disturbance a bound admits is admissible; so no admissible guarded history fails the essential floors exactly when some set of states containing the start lies within them and is closed under every admissible disturbance.",
+      "zh": "在市场模型中，对每组参数、界与起点：市场的历史与受守卫历史就是核心的历史与受守卫历史，以必要底线为守卫；界所容许的最坏扰动是可容许的；所以没有可容许的受守卫历史违反必要底线，恰当有含起点、在底线之内且对每个可容许扰动封闭的状态集。",
